<title>UK: World Bank sets 800 billion lire 15-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 800 billion lire 15-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana, J.P. Morgan and Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    800 BLN LIT   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    03.OCT.11</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  29.196    PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    27.346    YIELD	 9.029 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC   1.85</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE ON 03.OCT.06 ONLY AT 64.784</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
